Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:04.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:07.65,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.56,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:07.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:10.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:12.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:13.58,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:21.87,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:24.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:26.91,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:29.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:34.13,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:38.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:43.46,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:43.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:47.72,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:46.92,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:47.58,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:48.75,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:53.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:52.41,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.66,0:02:53.06,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.30,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:58.82,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:02.20,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:04.12,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:05.49,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:08.07,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:07.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:11.01,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.79,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:13.69,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.29,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:16.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:18.63,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:19.15,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:20.49,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:24.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,1. 2. 3. 4 Precure（5!）
