Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:11.43,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:11.68,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:12.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:17.52,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Let's Dance！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.31,0:22:20.90,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Let's Dance！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:21.61,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:23.69,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One Two Three Four Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:27.32,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:26.82,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,手掌向着太阳
